        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli kūngalūkīla SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a banhū ba Kiliati-yelimu biza būlīsola ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA, būlītwala ha ng'wa Abinadabu, walī na ng'witūnja lina lyakwe Elieza, būng'wīta kūbiza nang'hani walyo ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lisandīko lyenīlo līkikala ī Kiliati-yelimu ikanza ilīhu, myaka makūmi abīlī, a Baisilaeli bose bandya kūnkooba ū SEEBA mu kūlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūbawīla pye a Baisilaeli, “Ūlū ng'hana mulīngalūkīla ū SEEBA na ng'holò jing'we jose, lekanagi nabo a bamulungu a bageni, na Maashitoleti mūgīnje ū mu bing'we, ī ng'holò jing'we jingalūkīle SEEBA; muntūmamīle we wike, hū akūmupīja ū mu nkono gwa Bafilisiti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Baisilaeli būgīnja a Mabaalī na a Maashitoleti, bandya kūntūmamīla SEEBA we wike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bafilisiti kūpyenelwa Misipa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūhaya, “Balaalīkagi pye a Baisilaeli bize kwibilinga Misipa, namulombele kūlī SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bibilinga ī Misipa, būdaha minzī būgita kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; ū lūshikū lwenūlo būfunga na kūntambūūlīla ū SEEBA balīhaya, “A bise tūlī bahūbi ū kūlī SEEBA.” A Baisilaeli aho balī ī Misipa būng'wanukūla ū Sang'weli kūbiza ntongeeji wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a Bafilisiti aho bigwa gīkī a Baisilaeli bikumingaga Misipa, a basugi ba Bafilisiti būlinha bajile ūko baalī a Baisilaeli kūjūūbadumīla. A Baisilaeli aho bigwa gīko bogoha no kūlwa nguno ya Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla ū Sang'weli, “Yaya ū kooya ū kūnīlīīla ū SEEBA Mulungu wise kūlwa nguno yise, atūpīje ū mu nkono gwa Bafilisiti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūsola ng'wana wa ng'holo ataalī ong'ha, ūnsīnza ūmfunya kūlī SEEBA alī ngima gīko, kūbiza shitambò sha kūpemvwa. Ūnīlīīla ū SEEBA kūlwa nguno ya Baisilaeli; nang'hwe ū SEEBA ūng'wigwa, wīta gīt'ūmo walombelaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli aho alīfunya ī shitambò, a Bafilisiti būbasanga a Baisilaeli kwiza kūbadumīla. Alīyo ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū SEEBA ūbapalalūkīla būpalalūki būtaale no a Bafilisiti, kūshisha būzwangana kībi kībi; a Baisilaeli būbatūla būbapyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bīnga ī Misipa, būboolomya nhambo a Bafilisiti; būja bakūbabūlagaga nzīla ngima, kūjūshika kū sīlīlī ya Beeti-kaali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sang'weli kwīmīīlija iwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūsola iwe ūlyīmīlīja ha gatī ya Misipa na Sheni; ūliilīka lina lya Ebenezeeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ebenezeeli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, Iwe lya kūgunanha.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nguno akahaya, “Ū SEEBA ataalī ūtūgunanha kūshisha haha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a Bafilisiti būbiza baapyenwa gete, batashokile hangī kwiza kūbikolosha a Baisilaeli ū mu sī yabo. Ū mu shikū jose ja būlamu bo ng'wa Sang'weli, ū nkono go ng'wa SEEBA gwalī gūbahangīgije a Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo īyo Bafilisiti balī babataaja Baisilaeli, kwandīja Ekuloni kūshisha Gaasi, bīshosha a Baisilaeli, pyī nī sī īyo yalī bbihī bbihī najo ī mhandī jenījo, a Baisilaeli būbataaja a Bafilisiti. Hama na a ha gatī ya Baisilaeli na Baamooli yūbiza ho mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli akagwīta ū nīmo gwa kūbatongeela a Baisilaeli kūshisha shikū ja būlamu wakwe bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'waka wabayeleelaga a Baisilaeli, kwandīja Beeseli, hūna Giligaali, hama Misipa; waja akūbalamulaga ū mu mapandī gose genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma washoka Lama, nguno h'ūko yalī ī kaya yakwe, nū kwene wabalamulīlaga koi a Baisilaeli. Nīyo ū kwene walī wazenga na ng'walīlo kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
